@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Backhand three-shot sequence
Backhand three-shot sequence, two minutes. Straight drives in turn. Soft, on the service line,
bouncing in the service box. Medium, a racket head above it, bouncing behind the box. Then hard,
just under the service line, so it comes off the back wall.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
17% Soft. Medium. Hard.
58% Same preparation every time. Only the swing speed changes.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
